From c3f91d3d1f3e4d6752d0feb4050474bf1151d4cb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: A2Tools-patch <patch@localhost>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 18:43:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Meter: reset stays clickable while locked; the header's
 buttons in the plugins' order

- Locked, the meter's reset button stays clickable with the other header
  buttons; only the capture switch is still left out (lockedButtons.js,
  Settings' tip).
- The header's plugin buttons follow the plugins' order (the dock's tabs)
  at once when it changes, and the player row's TV button stands where the
  Streams plugin stands in it (its overlay, without a button of its own,
  leaves a hidden slot), no longer before all of them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012bGvDmLJG8nVqKXAfDMRub
